    "chunk_text": "1. US Dollars 7.2 billion is the projection of the IMF and is not a compulsion under the IMF -EFF Programme. By end August, 2025, the Central Bank had absorbed more than US Dollars 1.2 billion from the domestic forex market to build up Gross Official Reserves and the Central Bank will continue to monitor and implement necessary mechanisms to meet the requirements.\n\n6. No. There is no such plan. 7. The Central Bank already published the Gross Official Reserves along with details on People\u2019s Bank of China Swap on a monthly basis. In addition, debt service payments are published in the Central Bank\u2019s Annual Economic Review. 8. As stated above, it is the IMF projection for Sri Lanka\u2019s Gross Official Reserves and it is not a quantitative or continuous performance criterion under the IMF-EEF Programme.\n\n9. The Central Bank will continue to implement prudent measures in managing its affairs, considering many factors including evolving circumstances to ensure that its objectives are discharged, as intended.\n\nThank you.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dba\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0ba3\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0bc8\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake)\n\n\u0db1\u0dd0\u0d9f\u0dd3 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0da7\u0dd2\u0db4 \u0dba. \u0b8e\u0bb4\u0bc1\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0bb0\u0bcd. rose.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0db4\u0dba\u0ddd\u0db1\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0bc8\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) Yes, Hon. Ravi Karunanayake?"
