    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dba\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0ba3\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0bc8\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake)\n\n\u0db1\u0dd0\u0d9f\u0dd3 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0da7\u0dd2\u0db4 \u0dba. \u0b8e\u0bb4\u0bc1\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0bb0\u0bcd. rose.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0db4\u0dba\u0ddd\u0db1\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0bc8\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) Yes, Hon. Ravi Karunanayake?\n\nThe Agreement on debt sustainability between the then Government and the IMF had been endorsed by this Government, too and I salute them for doing it without breaking the trend. The external borrowers will basically look at the Government\u2019s intervention and if they find that the reserves are not being built up, it will have an impact on the rupee. We are being tutored by the Central Bank thinking that we are absolute duds to listen only to what they say. Sir, I want to protect the Government as well because those guys ruined the past governments and will continue to do so in the future also.\n\nSo, all I want you to do is to ensure that we have more exports and that there would be interventions that build up the Net Reserves. According to an answer you gave last time, Hon. Minister, China's swap was not acceptable. This US Dollars 7.2 billion target is not a fictitious figure that we have stated, but it is a target that you all are pursuing under the IMF Agreement on debt sustainability.\n\nSo, Hon. Minister, I would basically like to see a more honest answer coming from you. I know that you have got to report what comes from the Central Bank. But - I have been speaking with you about it - let us ensure that the Government pursues a policy that is good for the\n\n893 894\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dae\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0ddd\u0dca\u0db4\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\ncountry and not what is good for the independent Central Bank, which buys cars they want and increases salaries as they want while the rest of the country does not get those benefits.\n\nThank you, Sir."
  },
