    "chunk_text": "According to the agreements signed between the Government of Israel and Sri Lanka - G2G, Sri Lankan workers are being sent to Israel covering eight sectors and the most skilled workers are sent to Israel:\n\n1. An opportunity is provided for any person\n\nfrom Sri Lanka who meets the qualifications to apply for employment in a transparent manner.\n\npractical tests are conducted by the Government and recognized private institutions in each sector to select the most suitable workers.\n\n3. Sector-specific training and pre-departure\n\ntraining are provided to the selected workers.\n\nFor example, in the selection for jobs in the construction sector in Israel, the National Apprentice and Industrial Training Authority conducts pre-skill tests and the Israel national representatives select the applicants who pass final practical tests.\n\n1057 1058\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0db4 \u0dad\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bb2\u0bc8\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dae\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0ddd\u0dca\u0db4\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\nJapan\n\nDeploying Technical Interns and Specified Skilled Workers to Japan in accordance with the Memorandum of Understanding signed with IM Japan.\n\n1. Providing residential training, including\n\nJapanese language instruction to selected workers (four months for Interns and three months for Specified Skilled Workers)."
