    "chunk_text": "1. We intend to initiate the education curriculum reforms for Grades 1 and 6 in January, 2026. Then, subsequently in each year, we will be introducing the reforms for each grade progressively. The complete document on the reforms will be submitted very soon to the Cabinet for approval. Actually, prior to that, it will also be presented to the Ministerial Consultative Committee on Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education and the Subcommittee on\n\n1115 1116\n\n[ \u0dbb\u0dd4 (\u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc1\u0da0\u0dc1\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd ) .\u0dbb\u0da0\u0dca\u0da0.\u0dbb\u0dda.\u0dbb\u0da0\u0dca\u0da0. \u0d85\u0db6 \u0dbb\u0dad\u0dca\u0db1 \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dc1]\n\n2025 \u0db7\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dd0\u0dda\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd 25\n\n2. Yes. There are Tamil-speaking members in all of the committees appointed by the NIE.\n\n3. Yes. We are able to submit the names of those involved in drafting the concept paper as well as those engaged in the curriculum reform process.\n\n4. The Hon. Member has requested for the names of the Tamil-speaking members involved. There are over 100 involved in that process. I received this Question yesterday. So, I need a little more time to give you the names, Hon. Member, as they are still being collated. Also, the implementation of the curriculum reforms is under the purview of the officials of the Ministry of Education that we have appointed. There are Tamil-speaking members who are part of this process. Once again, if the Hon. Member requires, I will submit the names to him.\n\nThank you.\n\n\u0dd9\u0dd4 \u0dd2\u0daf\u0dc0\u0da5\u0dcf\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bc6\u0bbf\u0bb5\u0b9e\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba9\u0bae\u0bcd \u0bc6\u0bbf\u0bb1\u0bc0\u0ba4\u0bc6\u0ba9\u0bcd) (The Hon. Sivagnanam Shritharan) \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bcc\u0bc6\u0bb5 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bc6\u0ba4\u0bc8 \u0b85\u0bae\u0bc8\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0bc6\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bb3, \u0bb5\u0bbf\u0bae\u0b9f\u0baf\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bae\u0bc8\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba8\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0bbf!"
  },
